  "description": ".NET for Android / .NET MAUI bindings for the native Datadog Android SDK's dd-sdk-android-session-replay-compose module: ComposeExtensionSupport, which teaches Session Replay how to record Jetpack Compose content that the view-based recorder sees only as a single opaque surface. Built against dd-sdk-android 2.26.3. Register it with SessionReplayConfiguration.Builder.AddExtensionSupport. Most of this module is Compose extension functions, which do not project into C#; the extension-support type does.",
